{"overview":"ایچیکا دانش‌آموزی است که نوازنده است و می‌تواند وارد مکانی مرموز به نام «سِکای» شود؛ جایی که او و دوستانش همراه با هاتسونه میکو، عمیق‌ترین احساسات خود را از طریق موسیقی بیان می‌کنند. یک روز پس از یک اجرا زنده، ایچیکا با میکویی جدید که تا به حال ندیده بود، ملاقات می‌کند. هرچند این میکو جدید تمام تلاش خود را می‌کند تا بخواند، اما نمی‌تواند با دل‌های شنوندگانش ارتباط برقرار کند و برای بازگشت به آواز، باید به کمک دیگران تکیه کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ichika is a high school musician who can enter a mysterious place called “SEKAI,” where she and her friends express their innermost emotions through music alongside Hatsune Miku. One day after giving a live performance, Ichika meets a new Miku that she has never seen before. No matter how hard this new Miku tries to sing, she struggles connecting with the hearts of her listeners. Miku must rely on the help of others to find a way to sing again.","tagline_en":"My voice cannot reach anyone.","runtime":105,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["畑博之"],"crew_en":["Hiroyuki Hata"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"藤田咲","role":"Miku Hatsune (voice)","photo":"/pTHZZTerlaIHXOJkIzodMr1cfH0.jpg","en":"Saki Fujita"},{"name":"下田麻美","role":"Rin Kagamine / Len Kagamine (voice)","photo":"/qWxDiYJ9gLQq0Ev5GN3Y9i9mIfy.jpg","en":"Asami Shimoda"},{"name":"浅川悠","role":"Luka Megurine (voice)","photo":"/2n7pYsUrUq4qg4VtQemndzIpOlb.jpg","en":"Yuu Asakawa"},{"name":"拝郷メイコ","role":"MEIKO (voice)","photo":"/w3bcwDWf5C6bu1OIaXYKYS850gH.jpg","en":"Meiko Haigou"},{"name":"風雅なおと","role":"Kaito (voice)","photo":"/v5ETv1Pd8SV1ih5dO9T81SJajMt.jpg","en":"Naoto Fuuga"},{"name":"野口瑠璃子","role":"Ichika Hoshino (voice)","photo":"/zbuz55p5GCeHWu4ez17Phk4mLui.jpg","en":"Ruriko Noguchi"},{"name":"کارین ایسوبه","role":"Saki Tenma (voice)","photo":"/rZnJV3Pa3ykf03n7UEW12TVKH6E.jpg","en":"Karin Isobe"},{"name":"上田麗奈","role":"Honami Mochizuki (voice)","photo":"/2WV61uVU7y6XGYqNHLMpP0sApdu.jpg","en":"Reina Ueda"},{"name":"中島由貴","